Special Cron Strings

Instead of writing all fields:

Every reboot
@reboot /home/ec2-user/startup.sh
Runs after system boot.

Yearly
@yearly command

Equivalent:
0 0 1 1 *

Monthly
@monthly command

Equivalent:
0 0 1 * *

Weekly
@weekly command

Equivalent:
0 0 * * 0

Daily
@daily command

Equivalent:
0 0 * * *

Hourly
@hourly command

Equivalent:
0 * * * *

